#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/sharing.rst:6
msgid ""
"Sharing private documentation is useful for giving quick access to your "
"documentation to users outside of your organization. It allows you to "
"share specific projects or versions of a project with users who don't "
"have access to your organization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/sharing.rst:9
