msgid "HTTP Authorization Header"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/sharing.rst:76
msgid ""
"This approach is useful for automated scripts. It only allows access to a"
" page when the header is present, so it doesn't allow browsing docs "
"inside of a browser."
msgstr ""

